    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Mini Gallery</strong> is a simple, fast, and versatile gallery carousel plugin, now integrated with Elementor page builder!</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Upload and manage images easily for your marketing and content teams.<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight gallery carousel with shortcode support.<br />\n&#8211; Elementor widget support — easily add galleries directly inside Elementor pages.<br />\n&#8211; Now includes 11 gallery types for maximum flexibility and design options.</p>\n<p>🖼️ <strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com</a><br />\n🎯 <strong>Live Demo:</strong> <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com</a></p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Developed and maintained by Omar Ash Zeinhom.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Use the provided shortcodes or Elementor widget to insert galleries into your pages.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20it%20with%20elementor%3F'>\nCan I use it with Elementor?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! Mini Gallery 1.2 comes with full Elementor widget support, allowing you to insert and customize galleries easily.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20many%20gallery%20types%20are%20available%3F'>\nHow many gallery types are available?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>There are now 11 gallery types included with Mini Gallery 1.2.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.4</h4>\n<p>1 . Added Fix for <code>blockquote</code> in testimonials</p>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Fixed Pro Carousel Slide Animation </li>\n</ol>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added 11 new gallery types:\n<ol>\n<li>Classic Gallery (Original Simple Gallery) &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/grid-layout/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Full Page Slider &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/full-page-slider/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Grid Gallery &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/grid-layout/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Mega Slider &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/mega-slider/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Multi Gallery &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/multi-carousel-2/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Neon Carousel &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/neon-carousel-2/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Pro Carousel &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/pro-carousel/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Single Gallery &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/single-gallery/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Spotlight Carousel &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/spotlight-carousel/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>ThreeD Carousel &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/3d-carousel/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n<li>Testimonial Carousel &#8211; <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com/gallery/testimonials-carousel/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>Added Elementor widget support.</li>\n<li>Launched new website: <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com</a></li>\n<li>Live demo available at homepage.</li>\n<li>Updated tested WordPress version to 6.8.0.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated tested WordPress version to 6.7.1.</li>\n<li>Updated description for image upload feature.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A lightweight and flexible WordPress gallery plugin, now with Elementor support and 11 gallery types.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Mini Gallery</strong> is a simple, fast, and versatile gallery carousel plugin, now integrated with Elementor page builder!</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />\n&#8211; Upload and manage images easily for your marketing and content teams.<br />\n&#8211; Lightweight gallery carousel with shortcode support.<br />\n&#8211; Elementor widget support — easily add galleries directly inside Elementor pages.<br />\n&#8211; Now includes 11 gallery types for maximum flexibility and design options.</p>\n<p>🖼️ <strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com</a><br />\n🎯 <strong>Live Demo:</strong> <a href=\"https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://minigallery.andgowebsolutions.com</a></p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Developed and maintained by Omar Ash Zeinhom.</p>\n",
